28a7-db0e-11ef-8026-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吳王","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴王","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"951128a8-db0e-11ef-8594-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"壽夢","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿梦","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"951128a9-db0e-11ef-8db2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"季子","people_name_jianti_auto":"季子","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"951128aa-db0e-11ef-94b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"伯夷","people_name_jianti_auto":"伯夷","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"951128ab-db0e-11ef-a9a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"紂","people_name_jianti_auto":"纣","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"951128ac-db0e-11ef-bb94-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"季札","people_name_jianti_auto":"季札","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"951128ad-db0e-11ef-a079-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"951128ae-db0e-11ef-a9d2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：伯夷，孤竹君之子，讓其弟叔齊。季札，吳王壽夢之季子也，諸兄欲讓以國，季子乃舍其室而耕。皆是權時所行，非常道也。伯夷當紂時，季札當周末，故言亂世也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：伯夷，孤竹君之子，让其弟叔齐。季札，吴王寿梦之季子也，诸兄欲让以国，季子乃舍其室而耕。皆是权时所行，非常道也。伯夷当纣时，季札当周末，故言乱世也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"951128a2-db0e-11ef-9bb6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"衞靈公","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞灵公","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"951128b0-db0e-11ef-8296-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"輒","people_name_jianti_auto":"辄","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"951128b1-db0e-11ef-b18c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蒯聵","people_name_jianti_auto":"蒯聩","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"951128b2-db0e-11ef-bba0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"輒","people_name_jianti_auto":"辄","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"951128b3-db0e-11ef-a2f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"輒","people_name_jianti_auto":"辄","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"951128b4-db0e-11ef-88dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蒯聵","people_name_jianti_auto":"蒯聩","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"951128b5-db0e-11ef-a040-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蒯聵","people_name_jianti_auto":"蒯聩","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"951128b6-db0e-11ef-940e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"輒","people_name_jianti_auto":"辄","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"951128b7-db0e-11ef-aa38-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蒯聵","people_name_jianti_auto":"蒯聩","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"951128b8-db0e-11ef-a827-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"靈公","people_name_jianti_auto":"灵公","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"951128b9-db0e-11ef-871b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"輒","people_name_jianti_auto":"辄","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"951128ba-db0e-11ef-93ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"輒","people_name_jianti_auto":"辄","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"951128bb-db0e-11ef-8c6a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"駿","people_name_jianti_auto":"骏","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"951128bc-db0e-11ef-ab11-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"春秋：衞靈公卒，孫輒立，父蒯聵與輒爭國。公羊傳曰：輒者，蒯聵之子。然則曷爲不立蒯聵而立輒？蒯聵無道，靈公遂之而立輒。然則輒之義可以立乎？曰：可，不以父命辭於王父命，不以家事辭於王事。故駿引以爲言。","note_content_jianti_auto":"春秋：衞灵公卒，孙辄立，父蒯聩与辄争国。公羊传曰：辄者，蒯聩之子。然则曷为不立蒯聩而立辄？蒯聩无道，灵公遂之而立辄。然则辄之义可以立乎？曰：可，不以父命辞于王父命，不以家事辞于王事。故骏引以为言。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"951128af-db0e-11ef-bfa9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"侍中","official_note":"侍中是汉代中枢官职，掌管宫廷诏命和顾问，此处表示丁鸿被皇帝征召担任此职，以表彰其经学品行。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"上徵鴻爲侍中","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"ab8b25eb-ff11-420f-b2f1-88b0096b364e"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"季札，姬姓，名札，又称公子札、延陵季子、延州来季子、季子，吴王寿梦最小的儿子。公元前547年，吴王寿梦将第四子季札封于延陵邑。","link_td_id":"Q10002781","link_td_number_id":1295108,"people_name":"吳札","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴札","people_xingming":"季札","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"951128c9-db0e-11ef-b7ab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9511289a-db0e-11ef-a33b-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"cuī","source_anchor_text":"既葬乃掛衰絰於塚廬","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":35,"text":"衰","tongjian_id":"b6e6a8d2-e8dd-5179-83d0-184ea581f9fa"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9511289a-db0e-11ef-a33b-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dié","source_anchor_text":"葬乃掛衰絰於塚廬而","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":36,"text":"絰","tongjian_id":"5333f63a-13d6-59dc-a908-1d5a04368a4d"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9511289a-db0e-11ef-a33b-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhá","source_anchor_text":"昔伯夷吳札亂世權行","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":66,"text":"札","tongjian_id":"3300ee5b-1953-58b5-a539-d7e4607720e2"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"4初，陵陽侯丁綝卒，子鴻當襲封，上書稱病，讓國於弟盛，不報。旣葬，乃挂衰絰於冢廬而逃去。友人九江鮑駿遇鴻於東海，讓之曰：「昔伯夷、吳札，亂世權行，故得申其志耳。春秋之義，不以家事廢王事。今子以兄弟私恩而絕父不滅之基，可乎？」鴻感悟垂涕，乃還就國。鮑駿因上書薦鴻經學至行，上徵鴻爲侍中。","content_fanyi":"当初，陵阳侯丁綝去世，他的儿子丁鸿本当继承封爵，却上书称病，要把封国让给弟弟丁盛，朝廷没有准许。安葬父亲之后，丁鸿把丧服上的麻布带挂在墓旁守丧的草屋上，随后逃走。他的朋友九江人鲍骏在东海郡遇见丁鸿，责备他说：“从前伯夷、吴国公子季札在乱世中权宜行事，因此能够实现自己的志向。《春秋》大义，不因家事而废弃国家大事。如今您因为兄弟间的私情而断绝父亲永世不灭的基业，怎么可以呢？”丁鸿感动醒悟，流下眼泪，于是返回封国就位。鲍骏趁机上书举荐丁鸿经学精深、品行高尚，汉明帝便征召丁鸿担任侍中。","content_jianti_auto":"4初，陵阳侯丁𬘭卒，子鸿当袭封，上书称病，让国于弟盛，不报。既葬，乃挂衰绖于冢庐而逃去。友人九江鲍骏遇鸿于东海，让之曰：「昔伯夷、吴札，乱世权行，故得申其志耳。春秋之义，不以家事废王事。今子以兄弟私恩而绝父不灭之基，可乎？」鸿感悟垂涕，乃还就国。鲍骏因上书荐鸿经学至行，上征鸿为侍中。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"允矣，而犹未尽也。汉之列侯，非商、周之诸侯也。古之诸侯，...","context_before":"...，伯夷、泰伯为昭矣，子臧、季札循是以为节，而汉人多效之。","source_end_index":60,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"898e9ae9-9020-411a-a1dc-773315fa0d74","source_start_index":32,"source_text":"丁鸿逃爵，鲍骏责之曰：“《春秋》之义，不以家事废王事。”"}],"title":"六 丁鸿逃爵不义"}],"id":3582,"number":4,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十五 (漢紀三十七) / 顯宗孝明皇帝下 / 十年 / 第 4 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongj